; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6610      Reason:      Optimizations in some configurations lead to a constant expression.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6611      Risk:        None, even in configurations where the expresion is always true.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6612      Prevention:  verify by inspection that there is a configuration where the state is not always true
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6613  
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6614    MD_CanTp_OperationAlwaysTrue:
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6615      Reason:      Optimizations in some configurations lead to a constant operation.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6616      Risk:        None, even in configurations where the operation is always true.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6617      Prevention:  N/A
