; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6621      Reason:      local function declared without 'static', as in some configs it is externally visible and code coverage analysis may be erroneous if two different declarations are used
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6622      Risk:        none
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6623      Prevention:  N/A
