; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6884    \DESCRIPTION    With dynamic channel assignment, the RxHdl from the Rx state struct is used as index for CanTp_RxChannelMap.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6885                    CanTp_RxInit expects the state struct pointer to be valid and initialized, which implies that RxHdl
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6886                    is < CanTp_Cfg_GetNumRxHdls.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6887                    Since CanTp_Cfg_GetNumRxHdls is mapped to CanTp_GetSizeOfRxSduCfg in CanTp_Priv.h, the CanTp_RxChannelMap
