; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6894                    The handle parameter to get the channel must be valid. It is retrieved via the CanTp_RxSduSnv2Hdl
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6895                    indirection table (macro CanTp_RxGetSduHdlBySduId). The range and the availability (in case of post
