; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6918                    CanTp_Transmit. There it is derived from the CanTpTxSduId parameter via the CanTp_TxSduSnv2Hdl indirection
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6919                    table (macro CanTp_TxGetSduHdlBySduId) and CanTp_TxGetChannelPtr.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6920                    The range and the availability (in case of post build) of CanTpTxSduId is verified by DET.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6921    \COUNTERMEASURE \N Qualified use-case CSL03 of ComStackLib
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6922  
