; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6925                    CanTp_TxGetFreeChannelPtr and checked to be not NULL.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6926                    The handle parameter to get the channel must be valid. It is passed to CanTp_TxStartConnection() in
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6927                    CanTp_Transmit. There it is derived from the CanTpTxSduId parameter via the CanTp_TxSduSnv2Hdl indirection
