; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6961    \DESCRIPTION    Call to CanTp_TxInitState. The pointer parameter references CanTp_TxState[ChannelHdl]. ChannelHdl
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6962                    iterates from 0 to (CanTp_Cfg_GetNumTxChannels-1), where CanTp_Cfg_GetNumTxChannels is mapped to
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6963                    CanTp_GetSizeOfTxState and can be assumed to be in range.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6964    \COUNTERMEASURE \N -
