; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6976    \DESCRIPTION    TxConfPduId is used for write accesses to CanTp_TxSemaphores and CanTp_TxQueue. The PduId is read by
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6977                    CanTp_TxCfg_GetTxConfPduId / CanTp_RxCfg_GetTxFcConfPduId, according to the SduHdl and Direction parameters.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6978                    CanTp_TxQueueCancel expects that both parameters are valid and consistent.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6979                    For Rx N-SDUs, the semaphore is only used for flow controls, i.e. the TA-Type of the connection must be 'physical'
