; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6985                    function is called with direction = Rx, and RxHdl is part of the struct referenced by the pTpRxState
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6986                    pointer, which is a function parameter here and expected to refer to a valid Rx state.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6987    \COUNTERMEASURE \N -
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6988  
