; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  7062  \ID SBSW_CANTP_RXGETFREECHANNEL_WRITE_STATE
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  7063    \DESCRIPTION    Write access to pTpRxState pointer, which is initialized before, depending on the channel assignment:
