; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  7071  
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  7072  \ID SBSW_CANTP_TXGETFREECHANNEL_WRITE_CHANNELMAP
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  7073    \DESCRIPTION    Write access to the CanTp_TxChannelMap array, indexed by the TxHdl parameter. CanTp_TxGetFreechannelPtr
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  7074                    expects TxHdl to be < CanTp_Cfg_GetNumTxHdls, which is mapped to CanTp_GetSizeOfTxSduCfg in CanTp_Priv.h.
; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  7075                    The CanTp_TxChannelMap array must therefore have the same size as CanTp_TxSduCfg.
