; ..\_01_BSW\Src\CanTp\CanTp.c	  7391                                    For all Extended or Mixed11 or Mixed29 Addressing Tx N-SDUs (1-byte address offset), (CanTp_TxCfg_GetMaxPayload + 2) must be less or equal CANTP_MAX_FRAME_LENGTH
